{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"白世镜","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:kangmin"],"as_person":"person:canon:baishijing","ch":[22,22],"b":"text","ev":[[22,3,12,26,"6f7a54122e02b732"],[22,2,40,59,"ba7548a974d50907"]],"tag":"text","note":"阿朱仍是前一回扮成丐帮执法长老的样子，刚从马夫人处套得话出来；她事后自觉对方似乎起过疑心，所以马夫人是否全信并不确定"}
{"person":"person:canon:azhu","as_name":"虚清","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:putiyuan","believed_by":[],"as_person":"person:canon:xuqing","ch":[22,22],"b":"text","ev":[[22,30,0,14,"005a4ae0202b9765"],[22,30,15,28,"005a4ae0202b9765"]],"tag":"text","note":"回忆性交代：此前阿朱扮成少林僧虚清，入菩提院盗走经书，萧峰当晚亲眼见到；本回只是追述"}
{"person":"person:canon:qiaofeng","as_name":"乔装的汉子","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:guducheng","person:canon:fusigui"],"ch":[22,22],"b":"text","ev":[[22,100,40,55,"3a5b84db5fd29d7f"],[22,101,31,48,"16801378a39d57d8"]],"tag":"text","note":"萧峰在桐柏城与途中见古笃诚与傅思归时仍是乔装；因敬重二人，才当面卸去假面，自报契丹人萧峰。所扮是何人，本回未说"}
